# Environment variables for Car Value. Copy to .env and fill in; .env is gitignored and Claude cannot
# read it. In production the values live in Coolify (see docs/deploy.md).

# Optional. Microsoft Clarity project id. Public by design (it ends up in the browser).
# Without it, analytics stay off. Also read from app/streamlit/.streamlit/secrets.toml if present.
# CLARITY_PROJECT_ID=
